// directly, which is behaviorally identical (the thunk is only a tail jump to
// RAX). The tail jump 0x4e01c81 jmp rdx (rdx = 0xF99FFA0 slot, rax = vfptr[1])
// is likewise a tail call of obj->vfptr[1](obj).
